# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P15, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
press SEL
tapkey w15
release SEL
tapkey w6
tap PLAY
wait 3000
tap HOME
expect view 1
turn K2 40 60
turn K4 40 60
tap HOME
expect view 0
turn K2 40 60
turn K4 40 60
wait 1500
wav sing.wav
# @ P15 Falling, both resonances up (Pitch) and both cutoffs opened (Drones): the filters ring on the drones' notes
wait 1500
tap LFO
# @ keys 4 and 9 on the LFO pages move the filter LFOs to resonance: the ring swells and fades
tapkey b3
tapkey b8
turn K2 40 60
turn K4 -40 60
wait 6000
shot sing-0.png
tap HOME
wait 400
shot sing-1.png
wait 18000
wavstop
